```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --real

  :! std_string_real =
      `(
          rust::rust_type
              `($'std_string_String')
              `($'std::string::String')
              "type std_string_String = string"
      )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":== std_string = std_string_real\n\n:= to_string' \\* t. (x : t) : std_string =\n    !\\($'$\"!x.to_string()\"')","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
