### symbol_to_string

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --real --test --symbol\n///> gleam\n///> lua\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n\n:< testing\n:= x = ::test\n:= x = symbol_to_string_real `(`x)\n_assert_eq `string \"test\" x","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --real --test --symbol
  ///> gleam
  ///> lua
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda

  :< testing
  := x = ::test
  := x = symbol_to_string_real `(`x)
  _assert_eq `string "test" x
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

