#### to_char_array (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n///> lua\n///> gleam\n///> cuda\n\n\"abc\"\n|> to_char_array\n|> \\ x => array x : array _\n|> am'::to_list'\n|> listm'::unbox\n|> _assert_eq [ 'a'; 'b'; 'c' ]","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust
  ///> lua
  ///> gleam
  ///> cuda

  "abc"
  |> to_char_array
  |> \ x => array x : array _
  |> am'::to_list'
  |> listm'::unbox
  |> _assert_eq [ 'a'; 'b'; 'c' ]
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

