### string_builder_real

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --real\n\n:! string_builder_python =\n    `(\n        global \"import io\"\n        $'' : $'io.StringIO'\n    )\n:== string_builder_switch =\n    {\n        Gleam : string\n        Fsharp : $'System.Text.StringBuilder'\n        Python : string_builder_python\n        Rust : $'String'\n        TypeScript : string\n        Zig : string\n    }\n:! string_builder_real = $'backend_switch `(string_builder_switch)'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --real

  :! string_builder_python =
      `(
          global "import io"
          $'' : $'io.StringIO'
      )
  :== string_builder_switch =
      {
          Gleam : string
          Fsharp : $'System.Text.StringBuilder'
          Python : string_builder_python
          Rust : $'String'
          TypeScript : string
          Zig : string
      }
  :! string_builder_real = $'backend_switch `(string_builder_switch)'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":== string_builder = string_builder_real\n\n:= string_builder (initial : string) : string_builder =\n    := initial =\n        ? initial = \"\"\n        ?> ~~ initial\n        |: initial\n\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n        Lua = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n        Fsharp = \\ () => initial |> $'`string_builder ' : string_builder\n        Python = \\ () =>\n            global \"import io\"\n            global \"\"\"\n                class CustomStringIO(io.StringIO):\n                    def __init__(self, init=''):\n                        super().__init__()\n                        if init != '': self.write(init)\n                    def __str__(self): return self.getvalue()\n                    def __repr__(self): return self.getvalue()\n                \"\"\"\n            $'CustomStringIO(!initial)' : string_builder\n        Rust = \\ () => $'String::from(&*!initial)' : string_builder\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n        Zig = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ":== string_builder = string_builder_real\n\n:= string_builder (initial : string) : string_builder =\n    := initial =\n        ? initial = \"\"\n        ?> ~~ initial\n        |: initial\n\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n        Lua = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n        Fsharp = \\ () => initial |> $'`string_builder ' : string_builder\n        Python = \\ () =>\n            global \"import io\"\n            global \"\"\"\n                class CustomStringIO(io.StringIO):\n                    def __init__(self, init=''):\n                        super().__init__()\n                        if init != '': self.write(init)\n                    def __str__(self): return self.getvalue()\n                    def __repr__(self): return self.getvalue()\n                \"\"\"\n            $'CustomStringIO(!initial)' : string_builder\n        Rust = \\ () => $'String::from(&*!initial)' : string_builder\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n        Zig = \\ () => $'!initial ' : string_builder\n    }",
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

