<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= concat_array (separator : string) (input : array string) : string =\n    run_target \\|\n        | Rust => \\ () =>\n            $'Rc::<str>::from((*!input).borrow().iter().map(|x| &**x).collect::<Vec<&str>>().join(&*!separator).as_str\\\n                ())'\n            : string\n        | _ => \\ () =>\n            ({ acc = \"\"; sep = \"\" }, input)\n            ||> arraym::fold \\ { acc sep } (x : string) =>\n                    { acc = acc ++# sep ++# x; sep = separator }\n            |> \\ { acc } => acc","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := concat_array (separator : string) (input : array string) : string =
      run_target \|
          | Rust => \ () =>
              $'Rc::<str>::from((*!input).borrow().iter().map(|x| &**x).collect::<Vec<&str>>().join(&*!separator).as_str\
                  ())'
              : string
          | _ => \ () =>
              ({ acc = ""; sep = "" }, input)
              ||> arraym::fold \ { acc sep } (x : string) =>
