<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= clip (width : i32) (s : string) : string =\n    run_target \\|\n        | Rust => \\ () =>\n            $'{ let text = &*!s; if text.chars().count() <= !width as usize { std::rc::Rc::<str>::from(text) } else { std::rc::Rc::<str>::from(text.chars().take((!width as usize).saturating_sub(3)).collect::<String>() + \"...\") } }' : string\n        | Fsharp => \\ () =>\n            := count = $'(!s).Length' : i32\n            ? count <= width ?> s\n            |:\n                := keep = ? width > 3i32 ?> width - 3i32 |: 0i32\n                := head = $'(!s).Substring(0, !keep)' : string\n                head ++# \"...\"\n        | _ => \\ () =>\n            := s = dyn s\n            ? length s <= width ?> s |: s |> slice 0i32 (width - 4i32) |> append \"...\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := clip (width : i32) (s : string) : string =
      run_target \|
          | Rust => \ () =>
              $'{ let text = &*!s; if text.chars().count() <= !width as usize { std::rc::Rc::<str>::from(text) } else { std::rc::Rc::<str>::from(text.chars().take((!width as usize).saturating_sub(3)).collect::<String>() + "...") } }' : string
          | Fsharp => \ () =>
              := count = $'(!s).Length' : i32
              ? count <= width ?> s
              |:
                  := keep = ? width > 3i32 ?> width - 3i32 |: 0i32
                  := head = $'(!s).Substring(0, !keep)' : string
                  head ++# "..."
          | _ => \ () =>
              := s = dyn s
              ? length s <= width ?> s |: s |> slice 0i32 (width - 4i32) |> append "..."
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### clip_keeps_short_text_and_cuts_long_text_on_char_boundaries (test)

