<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= index_of_char_from (from : i32) (c : char) (s : string) : i32 =\n    := len = s |> length\n    := ^ body i =\n        ? i >= len\n        ?> -1i32\n        |? c = (s |> index i)\n        ?> i - from\n        |: 루프 (i + 1i32)\n    :& := 루프 i = join_body_unit body (? var_is i ?> i |: len) i\n    from |> 루프","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := index_of_char_from (from : i32) (c : char) (s : string) : i32 =
      := len = s |> length
      := ^ body i =
          ? i >= len
          ?> -1i32
          |? c = (s |> index i)
          ?> i - from
          |: 루프 (i + 1i32)
      :& := 루프 i = join_body_unit body (? var_is i ?> i |: len) i
      from |> 루프
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

