<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= builder_append (item : string) (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () =>\n            $'!sb <> !item ' : string_builder\n        Lua = \\ () =>\n            $'!sb .. !item ' : string_builder\n        Fsharp = \\ () =>\n            ($'!sb.Append' item : string_builder) |> ignore\n            sb\n        Python = \\ () =>\n            ($'!sb.write(!item)' : int) |> ignore\n            sb\n        Rust = \\ () => $'[(!sb).as_str(), &*!item].concat()' : string_builder\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'!sb + !item ' : string_builder\n        Zig = \\ () => $'spiralConcat(!sb, !item)' : string_builder\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := builder_append (item : string) (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () =>
              $'!sb <> !item ' : string_builder
          Lua = \ () =>
              $'!sb .. !item ' : string_builder
          Fsharp = \ () =>
              ($'!sb.Append' item : string_builder) |> ignore
              sb
          Python = \ () =>
              ($'!sb.write(!item)' : int) |> ignore
              sb
          Rust = \ () => $'[(!sb).as_str(), &*!item].concat()' : string_builder
          TypeScript = \ () => $'!sb + !item ' : string_builder
          Zig = \ () => $'spiralConcat(!sb, !item)' : string_builder
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

