<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= builder_replace (old : string) (new : string) (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () =>\n            global \"import gleam/string\"\n            $'!sb |> string.replace(!old, !new)' : string_builder\n        Lua = \\ () =>\n            $'((!sb):gsub(((!old):gsub(\"%p\", \"%%%0\")), ((!new):gsub(\"%%\", \"%%%%\"))))' : string_builder\n        Fsharp = \\ () =>\n            ($'!sb.Replace (!old, !new)' : string_builder) |> ignore\n            sb\n        Python = \\ () => ($'!sb.getvalue().replace(!old, !new)' : string) |> string_builder\n        Rust = \\ () => $'!sb.replace(&*!old, &*!new)' : string_builder\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'!sb.split(!old).join(!new)' : string_builder\n        Zig = \\ () =>\n            $'(std.mem.replaceOwned(u8, spiral_gpa, !sb, !old, !new) catch @@panic(\"out of memory\"))' : string_builder\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := builder_replace (old : string) (new : string) (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () =>
              global "import gleam/string"
              $'!sb |> string.replace(!old, !new)' : string_builder
          Lua = \ () =>
              $'((!sb):gsub(((!old):gsub("%p", "%%%0")), ((!new):gsub("%%", "%%%%"))))' : string_builder
          Fsharp = \ () =>
              ($'!sb.Replace (!old, !new)' : string_builder) |> ignore
              sb
          Python = \ () => ($'!sb.getvalue().replace(!old, !new)' : string) |> string_builder
          Rust = \ () => $'!sb.replace(&*!old, &*!new)' : string_builder
          TypeScript = \ () => $'!sb.split(!old).join(!new)' : string_builder
          Zig = \ () =>
              $'(std.mem.replaceOwned(u8, spiral_gpa, !sb, !old, !new) catch @@panic("out of memory"))' : string_builder
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

