<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= span_from pred str i0 =\n    := len = str |> length\n    := ^ body (i : int) =\n        ? i >= len\n        ?> i\n        |? str |> index i |> pred\n        ?> 루프 (i + 1)\n        |: i\n    :& := 루프 i = join_body_unit body (? var_is i ?> i |: len) i\n    i0 |> 루프\n\n:= char_contains (chars : list char) (c : char) : bool =\n    chars |> listm'::exists' ((=) c)\n\n:= trim_chars () =\n    [ ' '; '\\t'; '\\r'; '\\n' ]\n\n:= trim_start (chars : list char) (input : string) : string =\n    := chars = ? chars = [] ?> trim_chars () |: chars\n    := len = input |> length\n    :~ ^ 루프 (i : int) =\n        ? i >= len\n        ?> len\n        |? input |> index i |> char_contains chars\n        ?> 루프 (i + 1)\n        |: i\n    input |> slice (루프 0) (len - 1)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := span_from pred str i0 =
      := len = str |> length
      := ^ body (i : int) =
          ? i >= len
          ?> i
          |? str |> index i |> pred
          ?> 루프 (i + 1)
          |: i
      :& := 루프 i = join_body_unit body (? var_is i ?> i |: len) i
      i0 |> 루프

  := char_contains (chars : list char) (c : char) : bool =
      chars |> listm'::exists' ((=) c)

  := trim_chars () =
      [ ' '; '\t'; '\r'; '\n' ]

  := trim_start (chars : list char) (input : string) : string =
      := chars = ? chars = [] ?> trim_chars () |: chars
      := len = input |> length
      :~ ^ 루프 (i : int) =
          ? i >= len
          ?> len
          |? input |> index i |> char_contains chars
          ?> 루프 (i + 1)
          |: i
      input |> slice (루프 0) (len - 1)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### trim_start (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> gleam\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n\n\"  abc  \"\n|> trim_start []\n|> _assert_eq \"abc  \"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start []\n|> _assert_eq \"abcde\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start [ 'a' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"bcde\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start [ 'b'; 'a' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"cde\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start [ 'c'; 'b'; 'a' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"de\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> gleam
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda

  "  abc  "
  |> trim_start []
  |> _assert_eq "abc  "

  "abcde"
  |> trim_start []
  |> _assert_eq "abcde"

  "abcde"
  |> trim_start [ 'a' ]
  |> _assert_eq "bcde"

  "abcde"
  |> trim_start [ 'b'; 'a' ]
  |> _assert_eq "cde"

  "abcde"
  |> trim_start [ 'c'; 'b'; 'a' ]
  |> _assert_eq "de"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= trim_end (chars : list char) (input : string) : string =\n    := chars = ? chars = [] ?> trim_chars () |: chars\n    := len = input |> length\n    :~ ^ 루프 (i : int) =\n        ? i <= 0\n        ?> -1\n        |? input |> index (i - 1) |> char_contains chars\n        ?> 루프 (i - 1)\n        |: i - 1\n    input |> slice 0 (루프 len)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := trim_end (chars : list char) (input : string) : string =
      := chars = ? chars = [] ?> trim_chars () |: chars
      := len = input |> length
      :~ ^ 루프 (i : int) =
          ? i <= 0
          ?> -1
          |? input |> index (i - 1) |> char_contains chars
          ?> 루프 (i - 1)
          |: i - 1
      input |> slice 0 (루프 len)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### trim_end (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n///> gleam\n///> cuda\n\n\"  def  \"\n|> trim_end []\n|> _assert_eq \"  def\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_end []\n|> _assert_eq \"abcde\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_end [ 'e' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"abcd\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_end [ 'e'; 'd' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"abc\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_end [ 'e'; 'd'; 'c' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"ab\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust
  ///> gleam
  ///> cuda

  "  def  "
  |> trim_end []
  |> _assert_eq "  def"

  "abcde"
  |> trim_end []
  |> _assert_eq "abcde"

  "abcde"
  |> trim_end [ 'e' ]
  |> _assert_eq "abcd"

  "abcde"
  |> trim_end [ 'e'; 'd' ]
  |> _assert_eq "abc"

  "abcde"
  |> trim_end [ 'e'; 'd'; 'c' ]
  |> _assert_eq "ab"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

