<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= trim_end_suffix (suffix : string) (input : string) : string =\n    := suffix_length : int = suffix |> length\n    :~ ^ loop (text : string) : string =\n        ? suffix_length > 0 && (text |> ends_with suffix)\n        ?> text |> slice 0 ((text |> length) - suffix_length - 1) |> loop\n        |: text\n    loop input","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := trim_end_suffix (suffix : string) (input : string) : string =
      := suffix_length : int = suffix |> length
      :~ ^ loop (text : string) : string =
          ? suffix_length > 0 && (text |> ends_with suffix)
          ?> text |> slice 0 ((text |> length) - suffix_length - 1) |> loop
          |: text
      loop input
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

