<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ split_matches_from (str : string) (separator : string) (at : i32) (k : i32) : bool =\n    ? k >= sm::length separator ?> !+\n    |? sm::index str (at + k) = sm::index separator k ?> split_matches_from str separator at (k + 1)\n    |: !-\n\n:~ ^ split_next_from (str : string) (separator : string) (at : i32) : i32 =\n    ? at + sm::length separator > sm::length str ?> sm::length str\n    |? split_matches_from str separator at 0 ?> at\n    |: split_next_from str separator (at + 1)\n\n:~ ^ split_count (str : string) (separator : string) (at : i32) (parts : i32) : i32 =\n    := hit = split_next_from str separator at\n    ? hit >= sm::length str ?> parts |: split_count str separator (hit + sm::length separator) (parts + 1)\n\n:~ ^ split_start_of (str : string) (separator : string) (part : i32) (at : i32) : i32 =\n    ? part = 0 ?> at |: split_start_of str separator (part - 1) (split_next_from str separator at + sm::length separator)\n\n:= split_part (str : string) (separator : string) (part : i32) : string =\n    := from = split_start_of str separator part 0\n    sm::slice str { from = from; to = split_next_from str separator from - 1 }\n\n:= split_portable (separator : string) (str : string) : array_base string =\n    ? (sm::length separator : i32) = 0i32\n    ?> am'::init_base 1i32 \\ _ => str\n    |: am'::init_base (split_count str separator 0 1) \\ (part : i32) => split_part str separator part\n\n:= split (separator : string) (str : string) : array_base string =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () =>\n            global \"import gleam/string\"\n            ($'!str |> string.split(!separator)' : listm'::list' string)\n            |> listm'::to_array'\n        Fsharp = \\ () => $'!str.Split !separator ' : array_base string\n        Lua = \\ () => split_portable separator str\n        C = \\ () => split_portable separator str\n        Pascal = \\ () => split_portable separator str\n        Kotlin = \\ () => $'(!str).split(!separator).toTypedArray()' : array_base string\n        Python = \\ () => $'!str.split(!separator)' : array_base string\n        Rust = \\ () =>\n            $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!str.split(&*!separator).map(|x| Rc::<str>::from(x)).collect::<Vec<Rc<str>>>()))'\n            : array_base string\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'!str.split(!separator)' : array_base string\n        Zig = fun () => $'blk: { var parts: std.ArrayList([]const u8) = .empty; var it = std.mem.splitSequence(u8, \\\n            !str, !separator); while (it.next()) |p| parts.append(spiral_gpa, p) catch \\@panic(\"out of memory\"); \\\n            break :blk parts.items; }' : array_base string\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ split_matches_from (str : string) (separator : string) (at : i32) (k : i32) : bool =
      ? k >= sm::length separator ?> !+
      |? sm::index str (at + k) = sm::index separator k ?> split_matches_from str separator at (k + 1)
      |: !-

  :~ ^ split_next_from (str : string) (separator : string) (at : i32) : i32 =
      ? at + sm::length separator > sm::length str ?> sm::length str
      |? split_matches_from str separator at 0 ?> at
      |: split_next_from str separator (at + 1)

  :~ ^ split_count (str : string) (separator : string) (at : i32) (parts : i32) : i32 =
      := hit = split_next_from str separator at
      ? hit >= sm::length str ?> parts |: split_count str separator (hit + sm::length separator) (parts + 1)

  :~ ^ split_start_of (str : string) (separator : string) (part : i32) (at : i32) : i32 =
      ? part = 0 ?> at |: split_start_of str separator (part - 1) (split_next_from str separator at + sm::length separator)

  := split_part (str : string) (separator : string) (part : i32) : string =
      := from = split_start_of str separator part 0
      sm::slice str { from = from; to = split_next_from str separator from - 1 }

  := split_portable (separator : string) (str : string) : array_base string =
      ? (sm::length separator : i32) = 0i32
      ?> am'::init_base 1i32 \ _ => str
      |: am'::init_base (split_count str separator 0 1) \ (part : i32) => split_part str separator part

  := split (separator : string) (str : string) : array_base string =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () =>
              global "import gleam/string"
              ($'!str |> string.split(!separator)' : listm'::list' string)
              |> listm'::to_array'
          Fsharp = \ () => $'!str.Split !separator ' : array_base string
          Lua = \ () => split_portable separator str
          C = \ () => split_portable separator str
          Pascal = \ () => split_portable separator str
          Kotlin = \ () => $'(!str).split(!separator).toTypedArray()' : array_base string
          Python = \ () => $'!str.split(!separator)' : array_base string
          Rust = \ () =>
              $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!str.split(&*!separator).map(|x| Rc::<str>::from(x)).collect::<Vec<Rc<str>>>()))'
              : array_base string
          TypeScript = \ () => $'!str.split(!separator)' : array_base string
          Zig = fun () => $'blk: { var parts: std.ArrayList([]const u8) = .empty; var it = std.mem.splitSequence(u8, \
              !str, !separator); while (it.next()) |p| parts.append(spiral_gpa, p) catch \@panic("out of memory"); \
              break :blk parts.items; }' : array_base string
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### split_keeps_empty_and_edge_parts (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n///> lua\n///> c\n///> pascal\n\n:= parts = \"a,,c\" |> split \",\" |> array\n:= edges = \",a,\" |> split \",\" |> array\n:= pattern_like = \"a%b.c\" |> split \"%\" |> array\n(\n    am'::length parts,\n    am'::index 0 parts,\n    am'::index 1 parts,\n    am'::index 2 parts,\n    am'::length edges,\n    am'::index 1 edges,\n    am'::index 1 pattern_like\n)\n|> _assert_eq (3, \"a\", \"\", \"c\", 3, \"a\", \"b.c\")","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

