<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= split_string (separator : array_base string) (str : string) : array_base string =\n    run_target_args (\\ () => str, separator) \\|\n        | Fsharp => \\ str, separator => $'!str.Split (!separator, System.StringSplitOptions.None)'\n        | _ => \\ str, separator => str |> split ((array separator : array _) |> seq::of_array |> concat (~~ \"\"))\n\n:= join' (concat : string) (s : array string) : string =\n    run_target \\|\n        | Fsharp => \\ () => $'System.String.Join (!concat, !s)' : string\n        | _ => \\ () => concat_array concat s","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := split_string (separator : array_base string) (str : string) : array_base string =
      run_target_args (\ () => str, separator) \|
          | Fsharp => \ str, separator => $'!str.Split (!separator, System.StringSplitOptions.None)'
          | _ => \ str, separator => str |> split ((array separator : array _) |> seq::of_array |> concat (~~ ""))

  := join' (concat : string) (s : array string) : string =
      run_target \|
          | Fsharp => \ () => $'System.String.Join (!concat, !s)' : string
          | _ => \ () => concat_array concat s
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

