<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":! encoding = $'System.Text.Encoding'\n\n:= encoding_utf8 () : encoding =\n    $'`encoding.UTF8'\n\n:= utf8_get_bytes (s : string) : array u8 =\n    run_target \\|\n        | Rust => \\ () => $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!s.as_bytes().to_vec()))' : array u8\n        | Zig => \\ () => arraym::init (length s : i32) (\\ (i : i32) => convert::u8 (char_code (index i s)))\n        | C => \\ () => arraym::init (length s : i32) (\\ (i : i32) => convert::u8 (char_code (index i s)))\n        | Pascal => \\ () => arraym::init (length s : i32) (\\ (i : i32) => convert::u8 (char_code (index i s)))\n        | Cuda => \\ () => $'cp.array(list(!s.encode(\"utf-8\")), dtype=cp.uint8)' : array u8\n        | TypeScript => \\ () => $'Array.from(new TextEncoder().encode(!s))' : array u8\n        | _ => \\ () => s |> (encoding_utf8 () |> $'_.GetBytes') : array u8","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :! encoding = $'System.Text.Encoding'

  := encoding_utf8 () : encoding =
      $'`encoding.UTF8'

  := utf8_get_bytes (s : string) : array u8 =
      run_target \|
          | Rust => \ () => $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!s.as_bytes().to_vec()))' : array u8
          | Zig => \ () => arraym::init (length s : i32) (\ (i : i32) => convert::u8 (char_code (index i s)))
          | C => \ () => arraym::init (length s : i32) (\ (i : i32) => convert::u8 (char_code (index i s)))
          | Pascal => \ () => arraym::init (length s : i32) (\ (i : i32) => convert::u8 (char_code (index i s)))
          | Cuda => \ () => $'cp.array(list(!s.encode("utf-8")), dtype=cp.uint8)' : array u8
          | TypeScript => \ () => $'Array.from(new TextEncoder().encode(!s))' : array u8
          | _ => \ () => s |> (encoding_utf8 () |> $'_.GetBytes') : array u8
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

