<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":! str =\n    `(\n        rust::rust_type\n            `($'Str')\n            `($'str')\n            \"type Str = string\"\n    )\n\n:= chars (x : rust::ref str) : rust::mut' (into_iterator char) =\n    !\\\\(x, $'$\"$0.chars()\"')\n\n:= byte_slice (s : string) : rust::ref (am'::slice u8) =\n    backend_switch {\n        Rust = \\ () => $'Box::leak((!s).as_bytes().to_vec().into_boxed_slice())' : rust::ref (am'::slice u8)\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :! str =
      `(
          rust::rust_type
              `($'Str')
              `($'str')
              "type Str = string"
      )

  := chars (x : rust::ref str) : rust::mut' (into_iterator char) =
      !\\(x, $'$"$0.chars()"')

  := byte_slice (s : string) : rust::ref (am'::slice u8) =
      backend_switch {
          Rust = \ () => $'Box::leak((!s).as_bytes().to_vec().into_boxed_slice())' : rust::ref (am'::slice u8)
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

