<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= split_nth (separator : u8) (index : i32) (text : string) : string =\n    run_target \\|\n        | Rust => \\ () =>\n            $'std::rc::Rc::<str>::from(!text.split(char::from(!separator)).nth(!index as usize).unwrap_or(\"\"))' : string\n        | Fsharp => \\ () =>\n            := parts = $'(!text).Split(char !separator)' : array string\n            ? index >= 0i32 && index < am'::length parts ?> am'::index index parts |: \"\"\n        | _ => \\ () => no_arm \"sm'.split_nth\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := split_nth (separator : u8) (index : i32) (text : string) : string =
      run_target \|
          | Rust => \ () =>
              $'std::rc::Rc::<str>::from(!text.split(char::from(!separator)).nth(!index as usize).unwrap_or(""))' : string
          | Fsharp => \ () =>
              := parts = $'(!text).Split(char !separator)' : array string
              ? index >= 0i32 && index < am'::length parts ?> am'::index index parts |: ""
          | _ => \ () => no_arm "sm'.split_nth"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

