<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ellipsis_end (max : i64) (s : string) =\n    := len = s |> length\n    ? len <= max\n    ?> s\n    |:\n        := half = (max |> convert::f64) / 2\n        := start_half = half |> math::ceil |> convert::i64\n        := end_half = half |> math::floor |> convert::i64\n        := start = s |> slice 0 (start_half - 1)\n        := end = s |> slice (len - end_half) (len - 1)\n        [ start; \"...\"; end ]\n        |> concat_list \"\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ellipsis_end (max : i64) (s : string) =
      := len = s |> length
      ? len <= max
      ?> s
      |:
          := half = (max |> convert::f64) / 2
          := start_half = half |> math::ceil |> convert::i64
          := end_half = half |> math::floor |> convert::i64
          := start = s |> slice 0 (start_half - 1)
          := end = s |> slice (len - end_half) (len - 1)
          [ start; "..."; end ]
          |> concat_list ""
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### ellipsis_end (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> gleam\n///> lua\n///> fsharp\n\n\"12345\"\n|> ellipsis_end 2\n|> _assert_eq \"1...5\"\n\n\"12345\"\n|> ellipsis_end 3\n|> _assert_eq \"12...5\"\n\n\"1234567\"\n|> ellipsis_end 4\n|> _assert_eq \"12...67\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> gleam
  ///> lua
  ///> fsharp

  "12345"
  |> ellipsis_end 2
  |> _assert_eq "1...5"

  "12345"
  |> ellipsis_end 3
  |> _assert_eq "12...5"

  "1234567"
  |> ellipsis_end 4
  |> _assert_eq "12...67"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= format_ellipsis s =\n    s\n    |> format_debug\n    |> ellipsis_end 400\n\n:~ replace_regex (pattern : string) (replacement : string) (s : string) : string =\n    run_target_args (\\ () => s, pattern, replacement) \\|\n        | Fsharp => \\ s, pattern, replacement =>\n            $'System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.Replace (!s, !pattern, !replacement)'\n        | Rust => \\ s, pattern, replacement =>\n            := regex = pattern |> new_regex |> resultm::unwrap'\n            := s = ~~ s\n            !\\\\((regex, s, replacement), $'$\"$0.replace_all(&*$1, &*$2)\"')\n            |> cow_to_std_string\n            |> from_std_string\n        | Gleam => \\ s, pattern, replacement =>\n            global \"import gleam/regexp\"\n            $'let assert Ok(re) = !pattern |> regexp.from_string'\n            $'re |> regexp.replace(!s, !replacement)' : string\n        | _ => \\ _ => ~~ \"\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := format_ellipsis s =
      s
      |> format_debug
      |> ellipsis_end 400

  :~ replace_regex (pattern : string) (replacement : string) (s : string) : string =
      run_target_args (\ () => s, pattern, replacement) \|
          | Fsharp => \ s, pattern, replacement =>
              $'System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.Replace (!s, !pattern, !replacement)'
          | Rust => \ s, pattern, replacement =>
              := regex = pattern |> new_regex |> resultm::unwrap'
              := s = ~~ s
              !\\((regex, s, replacement), $'$"$0.replace_all(&*$1, &*$2)"')
              |> cow_to_std_string
              |> from_std_string
          | Gleam => \ s, pattern, replacement =>
              global "import gleam/regexp"
              $'let assert Ok(re) = !pattern |> regexp.from_string'
              $'re |> regexp.replace(!s, !replacement)' : string
          | _ => \ _ => ~~ ""
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

