### decimal_i32

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ decimal_from (text : string) (i : i32) (n : i32) : option i32 =\n    ? i >= length text ?> Some n\n    |:\n        := d : i32 = index_of (substring i 1i32 text) \"0123456789\"\n        := overflows = n > 214748364i32 || (n = 214748364i32 && d > 7i32)\n        ? d < 0i32 || overflows ?> None |: decimal_from text (i + 1i32) (n * 10i32 + d)\n\n:= decimal_i32 (text : string) : option i32 = ? text = \"\" ?> None |: decimal_from text 0i32 0i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ decimal_from (text : string) (i : i32) (n : i32) : option i32 =
      ? i >= length text ?> Some n
      |:
          := d : i32 = index_of (substring i 1i32 text) "0123456789"
          := overflows = n > 214748364i32 || (n = 214748364i32 && d > 7i32)
          ? d < 0i32 || overflows ?> None |: decimal_from text (i + 1i32) (n * 10i32 + d)

  := decimal_i32 (text : string) : option i32 = ? text = "" ?> None |: decimal_from text 0i32 0i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

