#### default_value_inside_a_fold_closure_keeps_the_captured_seed (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust -d regex\n\n:= pattern = new_regex \"(?<a>x+)\" |> resultm::unwrap'\nregex_captures \"yxx\" pattern\n|> am'::vec_fold' \\ found captures =>\n        ? found <> \"\" ?> found |: optionm'::default_value' \"\" (map::get \"a\" captures)\n    \"\"\n|> _assert_eq \"xx\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust -d regex

  := pattern = new_regex "(?<a>x+)" |> resultm::unwrap'
  regex_captures "yxx" pattern
  |> am'::vec_fold' \ found captures =>
          ? found <> "" ?> found |: optionm'::default_value' "" (map::get "a" captures)
      ""
  |> _assert_eq "xx"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
